ven-a-small-mistake-can-cost-you-a-lot-how-challenging-the-madring-f1-track-will-be/10853878/?utm_source=RSS&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=RSS-F1&amp;utm_term=News&amp;utm_content=www","reason":null}},{"publicId":"public-rss-af59f81302e860abab905621e5c7ac5e085bc27f8e6d7ff809fefbf5123258e4","contentType":"race_news","state":"ready","titleZh":"红牛签下基米·莱科宁之子罗宾·莱科宁","summaryZh":"红牛青训车队已签下2007年F1世界冠军基米·莱科宁之子罗宾·莱科宁。罗宾出生于2015年1月27日，自2022年起活跃于卡丁车赛事，曾参加Rotax Max Challenge，最初在瑞士参赛，随后转战欧洲各地；去年他还参加了WSK Super Master Series，两项赛事均按相应年龄组别参赛。","publishedAt":"2026-09-11T20:45:43.937Z","sourcePublishedAt":"2026-09-09T10:26:50.000Z","sourceTimeStatus":"known","source":{"sourceId":"motorsport-f1-news","platform":"rss","displayName":"Motorsport.com","byline":"Motorsport.com","accessStatus":"available"},"media":{"kind":"source_image","assetRef":"https://cdn-6.motorsport.com/images/amp/0rVP1bJ0/s6/robin-raikkonen-kimi-raikkonen-3.jpg","mimeType":"image/jpeg","declaredBytes":284275,"altZh":"红牛签下基米·莱科宁之子罗宾·莱科宁"},"originalLink":{"enabled":true,"url":"https://www.motorsport.com/f1/news/red-bull-signs-kimi-raikkonens-son-as-junior-driver/10853835/?utm_source=RSS&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=RSS-F1&amp;utm_term=News&amp;utm_content=www","reason":null}},{"publicId":"public-rss-ac63a37d5feb2d7d2569a54da7402c3e0f6d5c57487e9e987959713c9bb08596","contentType":"race_news","state":"ready","titleZh":"勒克莱尔蒙扎高速撞车未损引擎，西班牙大奖赛免于罚退","summaryZh":"勒克莱尔在蒙扎意大利大奖赛第二圈以超过230公里/小时的速度通过Parabolica弯时失控撞车退赛，事故起因是赛车碾过排水沟盖后弹跳。由于此次高速撞车未造成引擎损坏，这位法拉利车手不会因更换引擎部件而在本周末的F1西班牙大奖赛受到发车位罚退。","publishedAt":"2026-09-11T20:20:48.042Z","sourcePublishedAt":"2026-09-09T10:21:39.000Z","sourceTimeStatus":"known","source":{"sourceId":"motorsport-f1-news","platform":"rss","displayName":"Motorsport.com","byline":"Motorsport.com","accessStatus":"available"},"media":{"kind":"source_image","assetRef":"https://cdn-9.motorsport.com/images/amp/6zoDPjk0/s6/charles-leclerc-ferrari-3.jpg","mimeType":"image/jpeg","declaredBytes":394